      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SMOOTH BUBBLES (2) rocketed out of the boxes with a strong early sectional but gathered in and finished in the minors when second (17.48) at this track over 300m. Rates highly and will give a great sight. FINUCANE (1) is better than last start when seventh (18.48) from Box 7 at this track over 300m. Goes very well from this draw with two wins and two minor placings from four starts. Should be in this for a long way. PATCH OF BLUE (3) was in the minors two back (17.47) at this track but ran below best last time there, finishing 6th. Form here at the trip sound including two wins. Has the ability to give this a shake. PRIME BLUEY (7) can return to form after missing the top-three at this circuit last time out.",
